9110 0 obj
  << /ActualText (AirDJ is a screenless DJ performance system that frees performers from their booth\056 \n\nIt consists of four physical components\072 a wrist band that detects hand gesture\054 a mixer unit where DJ can turn on the AirDJ\054 a speaker unit that interprets the hand gestures and plays music\054 and a light system that responds to the music in real time\056 The system allows the DJ to step away from their station entirely\054 using hand gestures to control music playback while the venue lighting responds to the audio in real time\056)
     /K [ 1 ]
     /P 9111 0 R
     /Pg 430 0 R
     /S /Span
     /Type /StructElem
  >>
