9688 0 obj
  << /ActualText (More standardized gesture definitions\072\n\nGesture controls need to be more clearly defined and standardized to reduce ambiguity and confusion during performance\056 Each gesture should have a consistent motion range\054 direction\054 and corresponding system response so DJs can better predict the outcome of their actions\056\n\nMove activation button from the DJ mixer to the wearable\n\nAfter the first test run\054 we found that it is difficult for the DJ to move back to the mixer and turn off the button that activates air gesture\056 We decided to put the button to the wearable instead\056)
     /K [ 1 ]
     /P 9689 0 R
     /Pg 8985 0 R
     /S /Span
     /Type /StructElem
  >>
